# leads.db / leads.csv are deliberately NOT ignored: the daily workflow
# runs on an ephemeral runner, so committing them back is what gives the
# pipeline its memory. Without this, dedup resets every night and every
# lead looks "new" again.
!leads.db
!leads.csv
seen_ids.txt
dist/
build/
